Class: Aircraft
Responsibilities:
    - Recieve aircraft data from transponders
    - Read/organize data into Aircraft instance vars
    - Continuously read/unpack transponder data as vars change
Collaborators (if any):
    - …
    - …
Assumptions (if any):
    - Transponder is separate from ground station; doesn't need its own class/methods

Class: CraftData
Responsibilities:
    - Get unpacked data from Aircraft
    - Organize into database (2D array, etc.)
    - Organize data by time of arrival/departure
    - Continuously get info in 10 sec intervals
Collaborators (if any):
    - Aircraft
Assumptions (if any):
    - Station servers have memory to store all data from aircraft in vicinity

Class: DangerSense
Responsibilities:
    - Continuously read CraftData database
    - Determine whether vars create a dangerous situation
    - Categorize instances into specific danger types (collision, mech failure, etc.)
    - Send warning message to Display if danger
        - Specify which aircraft and type of danger
Collaborators (if any):
    - CraftData
    - Display
Assumptions (if any):
    - …

Class: Display
Responsibilities:
    - Retrieve organized data updates from CraftData
    - Display data in easily-readable format
    - Display specific aircraft data from CraftData when prompted by controller
    - Prioritize messages from DangerSense; overlay over other data
    - Visually emphasize aircraft in dangerous situations (as specified by DangerSense)
Collaborators (if any):
    - CraftData
    - DangerSense
Assumptions (if any):
    - UI designs are fairly simple
